        {
            "+content": "Living on Guicheng Island, called \"the most dangerous town in the universe,\" is no easy task. Genetic doping is common for gangs to gain ultimate power. Shizuka, a young girl, takes on the most dangerous of assassin jobs, but she’s not the one doing the killing. Rather, it’s her brother, Nagi, a strong assassin who took a bullet to protect his sister, leaving him in a comatose state and having to use a wheelchair. However, Shizuka has figured out the key to waking her brother up: he must be faced with murderous intent. Thus begins a violent journey of recovery, battling the most dangerous foes.",
            "+@gid": "3213458375",
            "+@type": "Plot Summary"
